Stakes-weighted ALL sign-agreement vs absolute burst steps:
   n      0      5     10     20     40     80    160    240    320
  10   89%   94%   95%   96%   96%  100%   98%  100%  100%
  20   90%   92%   94%   98%   99%   99%  100%  100%  100%
