Unweighted ALL sign-agreement vs absolute burst steps:
   n      0      5     10     20     40     80    160    240    320
  10   81%   89%   92%   94%   95%  100%   98%  100%   99%
  20   83%   86%   88%   95%   96%   97%   98%   98%   98%
